# Rust build artefacts
target/

# Cargo.lock is intentionally committed: NFR-BUILD-010 requires every dependency to be
# pinned by a lockfile, and the spikes' lockfiles are the record of exactly which
# versions the S-3 and S-4 results were measured against.

# Generated spike fixtures (S-1): reproducible from a seed per D-19.1, not captured data,
# and not worth carrying as binary blobs in history.
spikes/*/fixtures/

